NOTE ON THE UNDERLYING NEWS DATA

The KazSumm dataset is derived from a publicly released collection of
Tengrinews.kz news articles distributed on Kaggle under the MIT License. The
MIT terms above apply to the KazSumm compilation: the filtering pipeline, the
preprocessing code, the fixed train/validation/test split, and the
accompanying documentation.

Copyright in the individual news articles and headlines remains with
Tengrinews.kz and their respective authors. The material is redistributed here
for non-commercial research purposes, in the form of an annotated corpus for
natural language processing. Users who intend to redistribute the article
texts for any other purpose should contact the original publisher.
